{
  "category": "Wild Pigeon Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It can return to its Trainer’s location regardless of the distance separating them.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "Many people believe that, deep in the forest where Tranquill live, there is a peaceful place where there is no war.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "No matter where in the world it goes, it knows where its nest is, so it never gets separated from its Trainer.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "No matter where in the world it goes, it knows where its nest is, so it never gets separated from its Trainer.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Many people believe that, deep in the forest where Tranquill live, there is a peaceful place where there is no war.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "No matter where in the world it goes, it knows where its nest is, so it never gets separated from its Trainer.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Many people believe that, deep in the forest where Tranquill live, there is a peaceful place where there is no war.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "No matter where in the world it goes, it knows where its nest is, so it never gets separated from its Trainer.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It can fly moderately quickly. No matter how far it travels, it can always find its way back to its master and its nest.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "These bright Pokémon have acute memories. Apparently delivery workers often choose them as their partners.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
  ],
